["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">作る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つくる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">制造；生产；制作；建造；建设；烹饪；酿造；养育；种植；栽培；训练；耕种；开垦；起草；制定；准备；写；创作；谱写；创造；组织；建立；创办；生（孩子）；生育；化妆；装扮；编造；捏造；假装；装出；作出虚假的样子；排成；形成；创下（纪录）；犯下；作下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203324\">たまごを<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らずにオムレツは<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You can&#x27;t make an omelet without breaking eggs.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">造る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つくる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">制造；生产；制作；建造；建设；烹饪；酿造；养育；种植；栽培；训练；耕种；开垦；起草；制定；准备；写；创作；谱写；创造；组织；建立；创办；生（孩子）；生育；化妆；装扮；编造；捏造；假装；装出；作出虚假的样子；排成；形成；创下（纪录）；犯下；作下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"77679\"><ruby>例外<rp>(</rp><rt>れいがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るべきではないと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>います。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I insist that exceptions not be made.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">繕う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つくろう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缝补；打补丁；修补；织补；整理（发型、服装等）；梳理；打扮；修饰；装点门面；掩饰（错误等）；掩盖；粉饰；治疗（疾病、伤等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-i